@startuml Rule Group Query
title Query Rule Group Interface Activity Diagram

start

:Receive GET /api/rule-groups/{groupId} request;
:Parse path parameters;

:Call RuleGroupService.getRuleGroup();

:Query rule group entity;
if (Rule group does not exist?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 error;
  stop
endif

:Query rules in rule group;
:Build RuleGroup model;

:Batch query A/B test ratios of rules in group;
:Build RuleGroupDTO (includes rules field);
:Return 200 OK;

stop

@enduml
